<title>USA: McLeod holders approve name change.</title>
<headline>McLeod holders approve name change.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>McLeod Inc said Friday its shareholders voted to change the company's name to McLeodUSA Inc.</p>
<p>The name became effective on May 29.</p>
<p>The company said it has used McLeodUSA as a brand name for several months.</p>
<p>The company's trading symbol remains unchanged.</p>
<p>McLeodUSA provides integrated telecommunications services to businesses and residential customers.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
